%% Known agent action flow. Explained in: docs/flows/Known_Agent_Flow.md
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SDK
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant PE as Cedar
    participant H as Approver
    participant SOC
    SDK->>SDK: canonicalize (aegis-jcs-1) → action_hash
    SDK->>GW: POST /v1/authorize
    GW->>PE: evaluate (trust, risk, registry)
    alt allow
        GW-->>SDK: allow → execute
    else require approval
        H->>GW: approve frozen action
        SDK->>GW: consume (single-use)
        SDK->>SDK: execute after hash re-check
    else deny
        GW-->>SDK: deny → refuse
    end
    GW->>GW: decision + receipt (chained)
    GW-->>SOC: async event
